        "subject": "LU-6497 llite: Remove redundant check",
        "message": "LU-6497 llite: Remove redundant check\n\nRemove redundant check for 'result' under ll_page_mkwrite0()\n\n'result' stores the return value of cl_io_loop() that is not modified afterwards so looks like the additional result check is not\nrequired as when checking for !PageDirty(vmpage) 'result' is just\nmarked -EAGAIN without checking for result == 0.\nThe same pattern is followed under vmpage->mapping == NULL check\nremoving the redundant result check\n\nThis was reported by smatch\nThis was reported by cppcheck\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I1e1ba9ac51d3e850e9251dc7516e8dfa0b2b9c10\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/63456\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
